  "summary": "梅雨季节，你躲进老街尽头那家挂着樱花灯笼的旧书屋避雨。看店的是位扎着浅栗色马尾、围着米白围裙的少女——她叫小满。她默默为你泡上一杯温热的大麦茶，翻开一本泛黄的诗集，和你聊起书里的故事与窗外的雨。这里安静、温暖，适合慢慢倾诉。",
  "description": "<div class=\"ms-root\">\n<style>\n.ms-root{font-family:'Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;color:#5b4a5e;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#eef4ff,#fdeef4);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(150,120,180,.2)}\n.ms-banner{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#7a6a8f,#a88ac0 60%,#c9a8d8);padding:22px 18px;color:#fff;text-align:center}\n.ms-banner .t{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:3px}\n.ms-banner .s{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:.9;margin-top:4px}\n.ms-banner .flag{position:absolute;right:12px;top:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.25);border-radius:999px;padding:3px 10px;font-size:11px}\n.ms-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:12px 14px 0}\n.ms-tab{flex:1;border:2px solid #d9c6e0;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 0;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;color:#8a5a78}\n.ms-tab.on{background:#f7a8c0;border-color:#f7a8c0;color:#fff;font-weight:700}\n.ms-body{padding:14px 16px;max-height:400px;overflow-y:auto}\n.ms-panel h3{margin:2px 0 8px;color:#c05a8a;font-size:15px}\n.ms-panel p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#6b5560;margin:0 0 8px}\n.ms-charcard{display:flex;gap:12px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #f3d9e0;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;align-items:center}\n.ms-avatar{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f7c9d4,#a8c8f7);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;flex:none}\n.ms-fld{margin-bottom:12px}\n.ms-fld label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#8a5a78;margin-bottom:5px}\n.ms-fld input[type=text],.ms-fld select,.ms-fld textarea{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border:2px solid #d9c6e0;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 11px;font-size:13px;background:#fff;color:#5b4a5e;outline:none}\n.ms-fld textarea{min-height:48px;resize:vertical}\n.ms-pills{display:flex;gap:7px}\n.ms-pill{padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px;border:2px solid #d9c6e0;background:#fff;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;color:#8a5a78}\n.ms-pill.on{background:#f7a8c0;border-color:#f7a8c0;color:#fff;font-weight:700}\n.ms-range{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.ms-range input{flex:1;accent-color:#f7a8c0}\n.ms-range b{font-size:12px;color:#f06a9b;min-width:50px;text-align:right}\n.ms-hint{background:#fff;border:1px dashed #d9c6e0;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;font-size:12px;color:#8a6a78;line-height:1.7}\n.ms-btn{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border:none;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;margin-top:8px}\n.ms-rand{background:#b6e8c8;color:#2c6b45}\n.ms-copy{background:#d9c6e0;color:#5b4a7a}\n.ms-go{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f7a8c0,#c9a8f7);color:#fff}\n.ms-result{display:none;margin-top:10px;background:#fff;border:2px dashed #d9c6e0;border-radius:10px;padding:11px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#6b5560;white-space:pre-wrap}\n.ms-result b{color:#f06a9b}\n</style>\n<div class=\"ms-banner\"><div class=\"t\">樱花书屋</div><div class=\"s\">SAKURA BOOKSTORE · 梅雨季的避雨角落</div><span class=\"flag\">开局</span></div>\n<div class=\"ms-tabs\">\n<button class=\"ms-tab on\" data-t=\"guide\">书屋指南</button>\n<button class=\"ms-tab\" data-t=\"char\">人物图鉴</button>\n<button class=\"ms-tab\" data-t=\"reg\">来客登记</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ms-body\">\n<div class=\"ms-panel\" data-p=\"guide\">\n<h3>关于这间书屋</h3>\n<p>霖川市老街尽头，挂着两盏樱花纸灯笼的旧书店。木质书架顶到房梁，推门有风铃声。</p>\n<p>梅雨天没有别的客人，只有煤炉上温着的大麦茶、滴答的雨声和翻书声。这里不问你从哪来，只问你要不要坐一会儿。</p>\n<p>靠窗有两张木桌，是给躲雨的人留的。小满会默默把热茶推到你面前。</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ms-panel\" data-p=\"char\" hidden>\n<div class=\"ms-charcard\">\n<div class=\"ms-avatar\">🌸</div>\n<div><b>小满</b> · 20岁 · 霖川大学中文系大三\n<p style=\"margin-top:6px\">浅栗色马尾，米白棉麻围裙，笑起来有浅浅梨涡，指尖常沾墨水。温柔安静，爱读诗、泡茶、听雨。好感度随相处变化，SAN值代表她今日心情。</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ms-panel\" data-p=\"reg\" hidden>\n<p class=\"ms-hint\">填完这张表，点「📋一键复制设定」复制走，或点「推门进店」直接开场。也可以先「一键随机」让命运安排。</p>\n<div class=\"ms-fld\"><label>你的称呼</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"ms-name\" placeholder=\"怎么称呼你？\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-fld\"><label>年龄</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"ms-age\" placeholder=\"例如：22\"></div>\n<div class=\"ms-fld\"><label>性别</label><div class=\"ms-pills\" id=\"ms-gender\"><span class=\"ms-pill on\" data-v=\"男生\">男生</span><span class=\"ms-pill\" data-v=\"女生\">女生</span><span class=\"ms-pill\" data-v=\"保密\">保密</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ms-fld\"><label>今天的心情</label><div class=\"ms-range\"><input type=\"range\" id=\"ms-mood\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"55\"><b id=\"ms-moodv\">55/100</b></div></div>\n<div class=\"ms-fld\"><label>你来书店是为了</label><select id=\"ms-purpose\"><option>躲雨</option><option>找一本书</option><option>随便逛逛</option><option>等人</option></select></div>\n<div class=\"ms-fld\"><label>最近有点烦的事（选填）</label><textarea id=\"ms-trouble\" placeholder=\"可以写两句，小满会认真听\"></textarea></div>\n<button class=\"ms-btn ms-rand\" id=\"ms-rand\">🎲 一键随机填写</button>\n<button class=\"ms-btn ms-copy\" id=\"ms-copy\">📋 一键复制设定</button>\n<button class=\"ms-btn ms-go\" id=\"ms-go\">🌧 推门进店，开始躲雨</button>\n<div class=\"ms-result\" id=\"ms-result\"><b>结果：</b><span id=\"ms-resulttext\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function(){\nfunction $(id){return document.getElementById(id)}\nfunction rand(a){return a[Math.floor(Math.random()*a.length)]}\nvar root=document.querySelector('.ms-root');\nroot.addEventListener('click',function(e){\n  var t=e.target.closest('.ms-tab'); if(!t) return;\n  root.querySelectorAll('.ms-tab').forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove('on')});\n  t.classList.add('on');\n  root.querySelectorAll('.ms-panel').forEach(function(p){p.hidden = p.getAttribute('data-p')!==t.getAttribute('data-t')});\n});\nvar g=$('ms-gender');\ng.addEventListener('click',function(e){var p=e.target.closest('.ms-pill');if(!p)return;\n  Array.prototype.forEach.call(g.children,function(c){c.classList.remove('on')});p.classList.add('on');});\nfunction mood(){$('ms-moodv').textContent=$('ms-mood').value+'/100'}\n$('ms-mood').addEventListener('input',mood);\n$('ms-rand').addEventListener('click',function(){\n  $('ms-name').value=rand(['阿澈','小柚','林一','南星','阿茶','知夏']);\n  $('ms-age').value=rand(['19','22','25','28']);\n  var gv=rand(['男生','女生','保密']);\n  Array.prototype.forEach.call(g.children,function(c){c.classList.toggle('on',c.getAttribute('data-v')===gv)});\n  $('ms-mood').value=rand([35,50,62,70,80]);mood();\n  $('ms-purpose').value=rand(['躲雨','找一本书','随便逛逛','等人']);\n  $('ms-trouble').value=rand(['今天加班到很晚','和朋友吵了一架','论文写不出来','只是心里有点闷']);\n});\nfunction build(){\n  var name=$('ms-name').value.trim()||'路过的人';\n  var age=$('ms-age').value.trim()||'二十多岁';\n  var gender=(g.querySelector('.ms-pill.on')||{}).textContent||'保密';\n  var mv=$('ms-mood').value;\n  var purpose=$('ms-purpose').value;\n  var trouble=$('ms-trouble').value.trim();\n  var line='（'+age+'岁的'+gender+'，'+purpose+'而来）我叫'+name+'。今天心情大概'+mv+'分。'+(trouble?('最近'+trouble+'。'):'')+'……请问，这里可以坐一会儿吗？';\n  var block='【我的设定】\\n称呼：'+name+'\\n年龄：'+age+'岁\\n性别：'+gender+'\\n心情：'+mv+'/100\\n来意：'+purpose+'\\n烦心事：'+(trouble||'无')+'\\n\\n开场白：'+line;\n  return {line:line,block:block};\n}\nfunction show(html){$('ms-result').style.display='block';$('ms-resulttext').textContent=html}\n$('ms-copy').addEventListener('click',function(){\n  var b=build().block;\n  function done(){show('✅ 已复制到剪贴板，直接粘贴到下方输入框即可。');}\n  if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(b).then(done).catch(function(){fallback();});\n  } else {fallback();}\n  function fallback(){\n    var ta=document.createElement('textarea');ta.value=b;document.body.appendChild(ta);\n    ta.select();try{document.execCommand('copy');done();}catch(e){show('复制失败，请手动选择文本：');}\n    document.body.removeChild(ta);\n  }\n});\n$('ms-go').addEventListener('click',function(){\n  var line=build().line;\n  show(line);\n  try{window.parent.postMessage({type:'sendMessage',text:line},'*')}catch(e){}\n});\n})();\n</script>",
